{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14370","headline":"过章秀才洛阳客舍 · 姚伦","name":"过章秀才洛阳客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达人心自适，旅舍当闲居。\n不出来时径，重看读了书。\n晚山岚色近，斜日树阴疎。\n尽是忘言客，听君诵子虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}